id: pm-rlm-v2agg
title: Typed snapshot aggregation and one measured cloud comparison
description: "Budgeted count, sum, distinct, group_count and extrema; frozen-snapshot replay; one pinned seeded cloud evaluation."
type: Feature
pm_format_version: 2
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-19T05:53:47.468Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-19T16:42:44.674Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Six aggregate revert proofs; npm and Bun release gates; one honest 24-question comparison
parent: pm-rlm-a1ih
comments[20]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-19T05:54:26.312Z",codex-agent,"Plan fixed before live inference: six deterministic snapshot aggregates with no evaluation or code execution; len(field) means UTF-8 bytes, numeric fields must be finite, extrema return sorted tied ids, missing text is empty. Reuse existing budget, projection, ledger and replay paths. Pin both public source revisions and verify the same 24 selected questions. One invocation only, no answer tuning; include cheap generic precomputed-tool context arm if it fits."
  "2026-10-19T06:00:47.940Z",codex-agent,"Optional third arm omitted before inference to conserve owner quota: it requires 24 additional full cloud requests. The new harness verifies public visibility, exact historical revisions, complete corpus counts/bytes and all 24 seeded questions/truths before its exclusive once-only marker. Successful new runs are replayed. New raw response evidence stays in ignored local artifacts."
  "2026-10-19T06:01:38.699Z",codex-agent,"Revert proof receipt: count, sum, distinct, group_count, argmax and argmin each independently fail the exact scoped observation regression when only that operation is removed. All six passed behavioral revert verification in node test/v2-revert.ts; source bytes restored. Starting the only authorized cloud invocation with the implementation frozen."
  "2026-10-19T06:02:18.734Z",codex-agent,"Preflight refused before any model request and before creation of the once-only marker: removing the historical answer-format suffix had also changed seeded hash ranking. Preserve that suffix only in the hash input while retaining format-neutral emitted questions. This restores historical task identity rather than selecting a new evaluation set. No cloud quota consumed and no answer-dependent protocol tuning."
  "2026-10-19T06:09:33.391Z",codex-agent,"Both linked release checks passed under isolated Git identity settings: each ran 120/120 tests, 100 percent in all four coverage dimensions across 21 required sources, 72/72 documented declarations, zero duplication and 2/2 packed consumer tests. Added a recorded-shape test afterward (focused suite now 5/5) and strengthened packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx fixtures to demand a delivered count observation before a prose-wrapped finish. The strengthened packed tests pass 2/2. Final gates will run after the measurement/report and tracker writes are complete."
  "2026-10-19T06:15:50.358Z",codex-agent,"Current implementation gates pass under isolated HOME and Git identity: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each pass 121/121 tests plus 2/2 packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx consumers. Coverage remains 100/100/100/100 over 21 required source files; docstrings 72/72; duplication zero; production audit passes. Packed fixtures verify a delivered count observation and tolerate a prose-wrapped string finish. Source, protocol and eval implementation remain frozen during the one live run. Release workflows remain disabled for automatic publishing."
  "2026-10-19T06:41:40.644Z",codex-agent,"Interim single-run checkpoint: 10/24 questions complete; RLM 0/10, stuffing 0/10; delivered aggregates 5, reads 0. These are interim counts, not the final comparison. Measured code remains at verified source commit 4be91f0; no completed question was retried. Fresh-clone strict tracker health passed. Both complete release gates passed 121 tests plus two packed consumers each."
  "2026-10-19T07:28:28.154Z",codex-agent,"Single authorized glm-5.3:cloud run complete on the original fixed revisions and 24 tasks: RLM 1/24, stuffing 1/24; no accuracy advantage. Mean reported-or-estimated tokens 231491.58 versus 23623.29; seconds 204.60 versus 6.70; requests 32.00 versus 1.00. Child reach 0/24; delivered reads 0, aggregates 13; successful replay 1. RLM outer failures budget 23; tool refusals invalid 754; no model/transport failures in either arm. Most-common constant 2/24, zero 1/24. Observation charge 266 byte-estimated tokens; pending 0. Optional third arm was omitted before inference to avoid 24 additional cloud requests. No completed question was retried or answer-tuned. Measured source hash and commit 4be91f0 reproduce exactly; report and per-question artifact contain every counter."
  "2026-10-19T07:32:36.662Z",codex-agent,"Final full-gate receipt: npx pm test pm-rlm-v2agg --run --progress --timeout 900 passed all three linked commands under isolated HOME and Git identity. Focused suite 6/6. npm run release:check and bun run release:check each pass 122/122 tests plus 2/2 packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx consumers. Coverage 100/100/100/100 across 21 required sources; docstrings 72/72; duplication zero; production audit, pack allowlist, changelog and publish-attestation checks pass. Report regeneration is byte-identical and makes no model calls. No pm CLI/SDK defects were found; linked result tracking is disabled by project policy, so comments retain the durable receipts. All work stays in the package branch and release remains disabled."
  "2026-10-19T10:24:11.532Z",codex-agent,"Additional orchestrator-authorized measurement: preserve the prior v2 artifacts and the exact historical revisions, seed, 24 questions and truths. The default test:live now selects the constrained harness with a new exclusive marker and separate outputs. Same aggregation tools, same limits, same scoring, separate stuffing answer contract. No inference has run in this round yet; no retries or model substitution will follow provider refusal."
  "2026-10-19T10:52:58.356Z",codex-agent,"Single constrained-run interim checkpoint, not a final result: 8/24 tasks complete; RLM 0/8, stuffing 0/8; 295 invalid actions, 5 delivered aggregates, no reads or child reach. Schema-bearing native requests still return malformed or ambiguous action envelopes. Evaluation continues unchanged on source commit 495a156; no completed question is retried and no protocol, limits or answer scoring is being tuned."
  "2026-10-19T11:02:06.628Z",codex-agent,"Halfway checkpoint from the same invocation: original first corpus complete, 12/24 total tasks; RLM 1/12, stuffing 0/12; 447 invalid actions, 8 delivered aggregates, no reads or child reach. The second frozen corpus is now running. These are interim measurements; implementation, schema, prompts, task selection and limits remain unchanged."
  "2026-10-19T11:09:10.881Z",codex-agent,"Two-thirds interim receipt: 16/24 tasks complete, RLM 2/16 and stuffing 1/16; 586 invalid actions, 10 delivered aggregates, no reads or children. This is still the one authorized invocation on unchanged source 495a156. Full 24-question counts, usage, time and baselines will be recorded after completion."
  "2026-10-19T11:29:15.382Z",codex-agent,"Only newly authorized glm-5.3:cloud invocation complete on the exact original 24 tasks: RLM 2/24, stuffing 1/24; most-common constant also 2/24 and zero 1/24. RLM mean reported-or-estimated tokens 237461.75, seconds 131.256833, requests 37.458333; stuffing 23630.458333, 8.94475 seconds, one request. RLM total requests 899; stuffing 24. Delivered reads 1, aggregates 13, child reach 0/24, successful replay 2. Invalid actions 883; outer budget failures 22; no model/transport failures. Reasons: ambiguous trailing objects 797, ambiguous envelope 66, truncated object 17, no object 1, invalid JSON 1, schema operands 1. Native endpoint did not enforce the schema. Observation charge 9693; pending 0. Recorded source 495a156 and source hash 1b04b87807ff61eb35263a3b1c81dcf50124b227e6fbbb27c94ea143f72d0a47 reproduce exactly. Model-free report is byte-idempotent; no retries or answer tuning. Third arm omitted to conserve 24 additional cloud requests."
  "2026-10-19T11:34:34.597Z",codex-agent,"Final evaluation report and per-question artifact are linked. Model-free formatter passed through pm test and regeneration is byte-identical. Exactly one new live invocation used the original 24 tasks; no retries or answer tuning. RLM 2/24 versus stuffing 1/24 ties the most-common constant baseline; no recursive-quality claim. Final source passes both complete release gates (128 tests plus two packed consumers each). Measured native source is 495a156; the later OpenAI-only schema correction leaves native action/answer contracts unchanged. Public PR evidence and CI checks: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rlm/pull/8 . Release stays disabled; items remain open for verification."
  "2026-10-19T16:15:35.188Z",codex-agent,"Review round 4 verified all three unresolved PR 8 findings at 21a7ab0; the latest review body contains no additional outside-diff findings. Plan: explicit scalar type/value ordering with an independent aggregate checkpoint version (missing means legacy); portable escaped-path assertions exercised under Windows path semantics; filter empty report history candidates and identify the missing-history root cause. Add independent behavioral revert proofs and run both release gates under isolated Git identity."
  "2026-10-19T16:22:15.971Z",codex-agent,"Round 4 focused regressions pass 4/4 through pinned pm. Independent revert run passes 7/7: scalar comparator, new-run version stamp, legacy replay selection, legacy resumed reads, unknown-version refusal, portable URL assertions, and empty-history filtering each fail their targeted regression when reverted; files restored byte-for-byte. The Windows check executes the actual URL-test callback with Node Windows path/URL primitives. Legacy replay retains item data and root history bytes. Normal-environment strict health has only the previously recorded external extension-host version skew; integrity and history drift pass. Starting both unchanged-threshold release gates with isolated HOME and Git configuration."
  "2026-10-19T16:40:57.302Z",codex-agent,"Round 4 release evidence: pinned pm ran npm run release:check and bun run release:check successfully with isolated HOME, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null and GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1. Each passes 137/137 tests plus 2/2 actual packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx consumers. Coverage remains 100/100/100/100 over 23 required source files; all 87 declarations documented; duplication zero at the unchanged threshold. Production audit, pack, identity, changelog and publish-attestation checks pass. Existing development dependency advisory remains pm-rlm-wiav; external extension-host skew was already recorded in pm-rlm-v2parse. No new pm CLI/SDK defect found. Result recording is disabled by project policy; these comments retain the durable receipts. Final revert verification and commit integrity checks follow; no threads will be replied to or resolved."
  "2026-10-19T16:41:21.196Z",codex-agent,"Final behavior-only revert verification passed again after both release gates: 7/7 targeted assertions fail independently when each fix is reverted; source restored byte-for-byte. Final source and tracker paths are linked on this item. Claims are released for orchestrator verification; this item remains in progress. Commit identity, privacy, changelog and a fresh-clone tracker health check will be verified before push. PR evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rlm/pull/8 ."
  "2026-10-19T16:42:44.664Z",codex-agent,"Fresh git clone --no-local of the committed source passes build, identity, changelog and pm health --strict-exit --json. Required merge drivers, integrity and history_drift checks pass; the global extension mismatch is absent under isolated HOME. One nonblocking telemetry queue advisory remains, and telemetry configuration was not changed. Existing history records remain an unchanged byte prefix. Final receipt-only metadata will be included with the code and the exact final commit rechecked before push."
